Map'String'JSON
    • id id
    • root root.json

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
+ PaneRegion

+ kind PaneRegionKind
+ id String
+ side PaneSide
+ root PaneNode?
+ pages [PanePage]
+ strip = PaneStripMode.beside
+ size Float
+ is-collapsed = false
+ x Float
+ y Float
+ width Float = 380
+ height Float = 280

_ origin PaneTarget?

────────────────────
+ This
    - kind
    - id
    - side = PaneSide.left
    - size Float = 240

────────────────────
+ get json JSON

Map'String'JSON
    • kind kind as Int
    • id id
    • side side as Int
    • root root?.json as JSON
    • pages List'JSON(each.json in pages)
    • strip strip as Int
    • size size
    • collapsed is-collapsed
    • x x
    • y y
    • width width
    • height height
    • origin origin?.json as JSON

────────────────────
+ do stacks <PaneNode>

if root
    <<= root.stacks()
for page in pages
    <<= page.root.stacks()

────────────────────
+ page-named PanePage?
    - page-id String?

first(each in pages when each.id == (page-id ?? ""))

────────────────────
+ do page-index Index?
    - page-id String?

for index in 0 .. < pages.length
    =? index if pages[index].id == (page-id ?? "")
= null

────────────────────
_ do find PaneFound?
    - target String

. found = root?.find(target)
=? found if found
for page in pages
    . inner = page.root.find(target)
    =? PaneFound(inner.node, inner.parent, inner.index, page) if inner
= null

